kidneys from the heart.

97
00:04:52,550 --> 00:04:56,030
The major connection
between the kidneys and the

98
00:04:56,030 --> 00:04:59,470
heart is the aorta with
the renal artery coming

99
00:04:59,470 --> 00:05:02,230
