101
00:05:05,070 --> 00:05:07,870
Blood then flows
through the segmental

102
00:05:07,870 --> 00:05:10,090
arteries and interlobal
arteries which

103
00:05:10,090 --> 00:05:12,310
feed the individual
lobes of the kidney.

104
00:05:13,470 --> 00:05:16,390
Arcuate arteries basically
encircle the kidney.

105
00:05:17,730 --> 00:05:22,110
After the interlobular
arteries you then get to the

106
00:05:22,110 --> 00:05:25,070
