115
00:05:50,650 --> 00:05:55,390
The blood stays in the
peritubular capillaries, but

116
00:05:55,390 --> 00:05:57,950
about five to ten percent
of blood that reaches the

117
00:05:57,950 --> 00:06:00,530
kidney goes to the salty
medulla which is the inner

118
00:06:00,530 --> 00:06:03,250
